# S500 Quadcopter - ArduCopter V4.7.1 Parametre Dosyası
# Donanım: CubeOrange, SunnySky X3108S KV720, Hobbywing X-Rotor 40A,
#          Matek FCHUB-12S, u-blox M8N GPS, Garmin Lidar Lite v3,
#          FlySky FS-i6X/FS-iA10B, LoRa E22-900T22D, Jetson Orin Nano
# NOT: Bu dosya "temel/baseline" parametreleri içerir. BATT_VOLT_MULT,
# BATT_AMP_PERVLT, MOT_SPIN_ARM/MIN, RNGFND1_GNDCLR, COMPASS_ORIENT gibi
# değerler gerçek donanımda ölçüm/kalibrasyon sonrası GÜNCELLENMELİDİR.
#
# GUNCELLEME (18 Eyl): ArduPilot 4.6->4.7 rename'lerine gore duzeltildi:
# RTL_ALT->RTL_ALT_M, RTL_ALT_FINAL->RTL_ALT_FINAL_M, RTL_SPEED->RTL_SPEED_MS,
# RTL_CLIMB_MIN->RTL_CLIMB_MIN_M, SR1_*->MAV2_*, SR2_*->MAV3_*,
# ARMING_CHECK->ARMING_SKIPCHK (mantik ters donduAY, 0=hicbir seyi atlama)
# Kaynak: https://ardupilot.org/copter/docs/common-param-name-changes.html

# ---- Seri Port Tahsisi ----
SERIAL0_PROTOCOL,2
SERIAL0_BAUD,115
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL,2
SERIAL1_BAUD,57
SERIAL2_PROTOCOL,2
SERIAL2_BAUD,921
SERIAL2_OPTIONS,0
SERIAL3_PROTOCOL,5
SERIAL3_BAUD,38
SERIAL4_PROTOCOL,23
SERIAL4_BAUD,115
SERIAL4_OPTIONS,0
SERIAL5_PROTOCOL,-1
BRD_SER2_RTSCTS,0

